  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;……
投げ飛ばしてくれた恨み
忘れないからね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Ines&gt;. Don't think I'm just gonna
forget about you flinging me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>結果オーライじゃない。
細かい事気にしてちゃ
いい絵は描けないわよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All's well that ends well, right?
It's like how you'll never finish a painting
if you get too caught up in the fine details.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7028</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……気にしなさすぎると
&lt;Ines&gt;みたいな
お腹とお尻になっちゃうからねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I bet it's thanks to that same laid-back
attitude you wound up with all that
junk in your trunk, hmm?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……その余裕のなさが
キャンバスみたいな
胸にあらわれてるわよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, all your worrying didn't
get you anything now did it,
Little Miss Canvas Chest?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりとも、すぎた事で
ケンカしないで！
『すぎたるは及ばざるが如し』だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't fight over "too much" or "not enough."
Like they say, "too much of a good thing
can be a bad thing!"</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5006</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;……
『すぎたる』って
私のお腹の事かしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;... When you say "too much,"
you wouldn't happen to be referring
to my belly, would you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5007</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ど〜せ、ボクの胸は
『及ばざる』だよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I see.
My chest is "not enough," huh?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10272</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5008</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え？……あれぇ??</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? Did I say something bad?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5009</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Kohaku&gt;。
今のは的確すぎる
ことわざの誤用だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Kohaku&gt;. I believe that was an
inappropriate usage of the proverb.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
